The on-screen keyboard's word lists are built from two word lists in
https://codeberg.org/Helium314/aosp-dictionaries:

main_en_US.combined, the Android Open Source Project's English word list
(via OpenBoard), under the Apache License 2.0.

main_en_GB__experimental.combined, built from the Leipzig Corpora
Collection (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de) word lists, under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The British spellings,
common words and next-word data in en_GB.lex and en_US.lex come from it,
merged with the AOSP list.
